  "description": "Exports strongly-typed collections of DTOs to .xlsx using the attributes from Cayaqui.MPS.Metadata: Label for headers, Currency/Percentage/Date for cell formats, Align/ColumnWidth for layout, VisibleIn/Hidden for visibility, Order for column order, Badge for cell background color. Uses Syncfusion XlsIO. Proprietary — requires a commercial agreement with Cayaqui.",
